<title>UK: GSI sets warrants on the KOSPI-200 index.</title>
<headline>GSI sets warrants on the KOSPI-200 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International said it has issued 20 million American-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on the South Korean KOSPI-200 index.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 08.JAN.97-16.MAR.98   PAYDATE	07.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  KOSPI-200 = 68.09, INDEX = $0.08076</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p>	     STRIKE	ISSUE	PREMIUM     GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A    $0.08480    $1.08	18.38 PCT   7.48 X</p>
<p> CALL B    $0.09287    $0.76	24.41 PCT   10.63 X</p>
<p> --Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
